WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.964
P3.1 · Budget versions, approval and overlaps

2
00:00:06.114 --> 00:00:12.758
A budget is a plan for a fiscal year, not a closing. Each company in it moves through three statuses.

3
00:00:12.808 --> 00:00:18.459
With segregation of duties on, whoever submitted cannot approve. Every step is logged.

4
00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:26.799
The forecast uses only budgets flagged with the star. K-φ never picks between two flagged budgets for you.

5
00:00:26.849 --> 00:00:32.818
A banner lists each company and month in conflict; until you click Use, neither feeds that month.

6
00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:36.634
End the old flag where the new one starts.

7
00:00:36.684 --> 00:00:39.272
One company, one month, one budget.

8
00:00:44.268 --> 00:00:48.159
Next: P3.2  Creating a budget from actuals

